Enter odds for each selection individually into the calculator interface. Parlay Calculator accepts both decimal odds and American odds formats, allowing players to input values as displayed by their sportsbook. Most parlays require a minimum of two legs to qualify. Players add additional selections by clicking the designated field and entering subsequent odds values. Each leg represents a separate wager within the combined parlay structure. The calculator displays all entered legs in sequence, enabling review before proceeding to stake input. Remove any leg by selecting the corresponding delete option if adjustments are needed.
